# Original full-res PNGs and the pre-Next.js copies of the optimized
# web assets — the app serves everything from public/assets/ instead.
# Kept on disk for the design canvas above, not needed in the deployment.
# Anchored with a leading slash — unanchored "assets/" also matches
# public/assets/ at any depth, which is exactly what the live app serves
# images and the hero video from. That's almost certainly why they were
# missing in production.
